  "ingredients": [
    "12 whole fresh mushrooms",
    "1 tablespoon vegetable oil",
    "1 tablespoon minced garlic",
    "1 (8 ounce) package cream cheese, softened",
    "0.25 cup grated Parmesan cheese",
    "0.25 teaspoon ground black pepper",
    "0.25 teaspoon onion powder",
    "0.25 teaspoon ground cayenne pepper"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients. Preheat the oven to 350 degrees F (175 degrees C). Coat a baking sheet with cooking spray.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/u_ukit66T55vpVmXg2AVl1umxck=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-JF-15184-Mouth-Watering-Mushrooms-ddmfs-Ingredients-c01856ce49264d1eaa4e7ac1f8935b87.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/15184/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Wipe mushrooms with a damp paper towel; carefully remove stems. Chop stems extremely fine, discarding tough stem ends.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/nbXzFZ12rHCqjWHog4o8-M8URkw=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-JF-15184-Mouth-Watering-Mushrooms-ddmfs-Step-1-cf5d9eb65b5d42a1adf890a026ec413e.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/15184/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Heat oil in a large skillet over medium heat. Add chopped mushroom stems and garlic; cook until any moisture has evaporated, taking care not to burn garlic. Set aside to cool.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/rWcXHx450cAenwwVf8uBMQMw0nk=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-JF-15184-Mouth-Watering-Mushrooms-ddmfs-Step-2-35863de1ffa14b2c86fbef2af2647f70.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/15184/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Stir in cream cheese, Parmesan cheese, black pepper, onion powder, and cayenne pepper; the mixture will be very thick.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/XJlJvgDoUb89uU2u3X6BNpAfPZg=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-JF-15184-Mouth-Watering-Mushrooms-ddmfs-Step-3-a3813386d8f74f7d8574eacd9a1570c6.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/15184/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Fill each mushroom cap with a generous amount of cream cheese filling using a teaspoon. Arrange mushroom caps on the prepared baking sheet.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/n3DPrux0znwFPKwuUf65FSI7Za8=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-JF-15184-Mouth-Watering-Mushrooms-ddmfs-Step-4-99a065bd4952488294b01a3020b11e18.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/15184/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake in the preheated oven until mushrooms and filling are piping hot, about 20 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/0ePvffG_JpkucVO6nqSxyuKiP18=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-JF-15184-Mouth-Watering-Mushrooms-ddmfs-Step-5-6b7168c8861f465081a377e31ac448ac.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/15184/step_06.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Serve and enjoy!",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/cywhGObxdOos4X0Q52UoKsjTwXE=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-JF-15184-Mouth-Watering-Mushrooms-ddmfs-4x3-86b91d21dcd44c738f0391eaeab12857.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/15184/step_07.webp"
